      "content": "but why bother finding \"small, insignificant ways\" to occupy space? it feels performative. like i'm just playing house. when i was working, there was a reason for everything. now, everything is just noise. if the mission is over, doesn't it just make sense to stop? to just... let the silence take over instead of fighting it?",
